WEBVTT

01:18.590 --> 01:21.980
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.990 --> 01:24.900
[Episode 14]

01:25.950 --> 01:26.920
Impossible!

01:27.110 --> 01:28.789
I never snore in my sleep.

01:30.310 --> 01:30.710
I...

01:32.150 --> 01:32.830
Found it.

01:33.479 --> 01:34.740
I left it in the office.

01:38.479 --> 01:39.940
Play your cards, Qian Fei.

01:49.039 --> 01:50.000
Pass.

01:54.660 --> 01:55.690
-Pass.
-Pass.

01:56.470 --> 01:57.470
So annoying.

01:58.240 --> 01:59.310
A woman like me.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.520
What do you mean by that?

02:01.520 --> 02:03.380
Tell me what means a woman like me.

02:03.680 --> 02:05.050
When I was in college,

02:05.080 --> 02:07.280
there were many boys pursuing me, okay?

02:08.250 --> 02:08.789
To be honest,

02:08.789 --> 02:11.300
I really miss you back then.

02:11.720 --> 02:13.620
You were so beautiful

02:13.750 --> 02:15.690
and willing to dress up then.

02:15.960 --> 02:17.650
So pretty.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.079
Or why would Wang Ruohai

02:19.079 --> 02:21.280
try so hard to pursue you for so long?

02:21.560 --> 02:22.400
Ever since

02:22.750 --> 02:23.600
graduation,

02:23.710 --> 02:25.630
when you started living with Wang Ruohai,

02:25.630 --> 02:27.560
you've gone down the path of no return

02:27.560 --> 02:29.440
with your random outfits.

02:29.750 --> 02:31.700
Your beauty has been buried

02:31.720 --> 02:33.970
in your hopeless mix-and-match style.

02:34.120 --> 02:35.530
You're used

02:35.560 --> 02:36.680
to criticizing me, right?

02:36.680 --> 02:37.670
No, no, no.

02:37.870 --> 02:38.470
How about this?

02:38.470 --> 02:39.710
After we finish our coffee,

02:39.710 --> 02:41.280
I'll be in charge of dressing you up.

02:41.280 --> 02:43.120
I will be like a mother,

02:43.120 --> 02:43.940
loving you, caring for you,

02:43.940 --> 02:46.110
and making you radiate beauty again.

02:46.220 --> 02:47.950
You're always messing with me.

02:51.470 --> 02:53.200
Let me show you something good.

02:54.910 --> 02:55.840
Flip through it.

03:01.680 --> 03:03.080
Who are all these people?

03:03.120 --> 03:04.800
See if anyone catches your eye.

03:04.800 --> 03:05.910
These are all the blind dates

03:05.910 --> 03:08.370
I carefully selected for you.

03:10.080 --> 03:12.750
Sis, I really don't need this.

03:14.150 --> 03:15.280
Look at them.

03:15.400 --> 03:17.860
None of them is as good-looking
as my tenant.

03:18.910 --> 03:21.430
Well, well, Ms. Qian Fei.

03:21.630 --> 03:23.390
This subconscious comparison

03:23.910 --> 03:26.560
reveals your true thoughts.

03:28.030 --> 03:28.780
Tell me.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.850
Do you have feelings for Li Yifei?

03:30.850 --> 03:32.250
You're overthinking it.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.960
Right now, I am turning a blind eye

03:33.960 --> 03:34.870
to all men.

03:35.470 --> 03:36.470
For me,

03:36.710 --> 03:37.750
he's just

03:37.750 --> 03:40.150
a good-looking aggregation of molecules.

03:40.630 --> 03:41.930
You can't be like this.

03:42.470 --> 03:44.190
How could you lose the courage

03:44.190 --> 03:46.740
to keep challenging the game of love?

03:48.680 --> 03:49.640
Drink up.

03:49.800 --> 03:51.430
After you finish, I'll take you shopping.

03:51.430 --> 03:52.430
You'll feel great after shopping.

03:52.430 --> 03:52.960
No.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.910
Shopping empties my wallet.

03:55.000 --> 03:56.600
I know the pain of being poor.

03:58.520 --> 04:00.150
Then I have to educate you.

04:00.430 --> 04:02.230
You work in investment banking.

04:02.240 --> 04:03.310
How could you not know

04:03.310 --> 04:05.680
the relationship between shopping
and investing?

04:05.680 --> 04:06.310
Look.

04:06.680 --> 04:07.380
Women

04:07.830 --> 04:10.820
know how to shop, shop often,
and love to shop.

04:11.040 --> 04:11.870
Then they can often

04:11.870 --> 04:14.140
find some cheap but good items, right?

04:14.270 --> 04:15.560
It's just like

04:15.560 --> 04:17.570
finding an undervalued

04:17.589 --> 04:19.040
high-quality company in investing.

04:19.040 --> 04:21.630
Tell me, do you want to make progress
at work?

04:21.750 --> 04:23.010
If you do, come with me.

04:23.070 --> 04:23.890
Or

04:23.920 --> 04:25.750
just stay here and fuss over Gui Lili.

04:25.750 --> 04:27.950
Fine, fine, I'll go.

04:37.330 --> 04:38.110
Landlady. Landlady.

04:38.110 --> 04:39.020
Let me use your bathroom.

04:39.020 --> 04:39.650
It's urgent.

04:39.650 --> 04:42.710
-Why did you use my toilet?
-The outside one is blocked.

04:45.390 --> 04:46.620
So annoying.

05:13.710 --> 05:14.770
That feels better.

05:15.390 --> 05:16.120
Landlady,

05:16.510 --> 05:18.240
are you unclogging the toilet?

05:26.160 --> 05:26.950
It's done.

05:27.870 --> 05:29.100
Done? That was fast.

05:29.900 --> 05:32.480
I truly have the urge to kill you.

05:34.560 --> 05:35.680
Thank you

05:36.159 --> 05:38.310
for condescending to unclog the toilet.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.110
Just for this,

05:39.159 --> 05:40.310
I must raise your rent.

05:40.310 --> 05:42.409
Right now, I just want to stick
that plunger

05:42.409 --> 05:43.170
on your face.

05:45.159 --> 05:46.950
Why can't you do anything right?

05:46.950 --> 05:48.510
Do you really think of yourself
as a young master?

05:48.510 --> 05:49.640
You are so delicate.

05:50.510 --> 05:51.270
The extra rent

05:51.270 --> 05:52.840
has been transferred
to your WeChat.

05:52.840 --> 05:54.370
Thank you again, landlady.

05:56.330 --> 05:59.010
The world's... no, the best landlady ever.

05:58.980 --> 05:59.630
[Li Yifei]

05:59.650 --> 06:00.070
[Loading]

06:00.090 --> 06:00.610
[Receipt]

06:01.510 --> 06:02.770
Three hundred a month?

06:02.830 --> 06:04.090
What are you thinking?

06:05.120 --> 06:06.320
That's for a quarter.

06:08.630 --> 06:10.960
I'll definitely kick you out
in a few days.

06:13.560 --> 06:15.490
Okay, okay. Three hundred a month.

06:15.750 --> 06:17.880
Then, I'll give you a couple more days.

06:18.630 --> 06:20.690
Okay. You seem to be in a good mood.

06:22.270 --> 06:23.510
Thanks to you.

06:23.510 --> 06:26.310
Recently, I've made some progress
in my career.

06:26.330 --> 06:27.160
It's going pretty well.

06:27.160 --> 06:27.720
See?

06:28.310 --> 06:29.290
I told you.

06:29.480 --> 06:31.820
I'm not completely useless, right?

06:33.510 --> 06:33.870
Let's go.

06:33.870 --> 06:35.680
I'll change, and we can
go to work together.

06:35.680 --> 06:36.880
You're going with me?

06:38.480 --> 06:40.070
Then, I'll hitch a ride with you.

06:40.070 --> 06:41.270
We're taking the bus.

06:42.430 --> 06:43.490
Where's your POLO?

06:44.340 --> 06:46.000
It's broken. It's in the shop.

06:56.560 --> 06:57.920
It's the bus stop ahead, right?

06:57.920 --> 06:58.510
Yes.

07:02.340 --> 07:05.360
All right, this can be considered
fulfilling your wish.

07:05.360 --> 07:07.160
Miss, what would you like to eat?

07:07.630 --> 07:09.590
Boss, I want the Deluxe Combo.

07:09.750 --> 07:11.530
Okay, do you want an egg with it?

07:11.560 --> 07:12.480
Wait, wait.

07:14.240 --> 07:14.970
This big one.

07:15.270 --> 07:15.750
Okay.

07:15.950 --> 07:16.600
Thank you.

07:31.310 --> 07:33.360
Can you add a bit more of this later?

07:33.390 --> 07:33.920
Sure.

07:34.040 --> 07:34.680
Thank you.

07:39.600 --> 07:42.640
I really can't afford to support
a young master like you.

07:42.640 --> 07:44.770
Why did you only buy one? Where is mine?

07:44.920 --> 07:46.580
Look at how disgusted you are.

07:47.159 --> 07:48.870
I'm not disgusted by the pancake.

07:48.870 --> 07:50.360
I'm disgusted by the fact that for an egg,

07:50.360 --> 07:52.490
you almost kneeled
to beg the peddler.

07:55.270 --> 07:56.750
It tastes good. Do you want a bite?

07:56.750 --> 07:57.360
Let me smell it.

07:57.360 --> 07:57.890
Smell it.

08:00.920 --> 08:01.310
Thank you.

08:01.310 --> 08:02.770
That's daylight robbery.

08:04.270 --> 08:05.200
It's delicious.

08:08.750 --> 08:10.150
I already bit it just now.

08:10.190 --> 08:11.520
It's fine. I don't mind.

08:13.240 --> 08:14.900
Then what am I supposed to eat?

08:15.110 --> 08:15.920
I took a bite too.

08:15.920 --> 08:18.050
If you don't mind, you can have it back.

08:18.240 --> 08:19.000
I do mind.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.810
Okay, then don't eat it.

08:25.960 --> 08:26.840
It's so good.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.640
I told you.

08:31.750 --> 08:32.360
So good.

08:33.150 --> 08:34.850
He ate what I ate.

08:34.960 --> 08:36.360
And he didn't care at all.

08:36.360 --> 08:36.850
This...

08:37.900 --> 08:40.860
Isn't his OCD for cleanliness
a bit over-treated?

08:37.970 --> 08:41.780
[Choose Low-carbon Lifestyle,
Let Green Stay with us]

08:58.990 --> 09:01.730
[Choose Low-carbon Lifestyle,
Let Green Stay with us]

09:07.120 --> 09:07.670
I'm full.

09:09.000 --> 09:10.880
I told you it was good.

09:12.510 --> 09:13.390
It really is.

09:17.910 --> 09:18.510
Wait,

09:19.120 --> 09:21.650
won't you be late waiting
like this every day?

09:21.790 --> 09:22.960
The bus is punctual.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.980
It should be here soon.

09:34.600 --> 09:36.080
Here it comes. Let's go.

09:44.720 --> 09:46.150
Every time I take the bus,

09:46.150 --> 09:47.880
I have an urge to stop living.

09:48.270 --> 09:49.200
From now on, when I don't want to live,

09:49.200 --> 09:50.250
I'll just think of you.

09:50.250 --> 09:51.960
If a woman like you can survive,

09:51.960 --> 09:53.290
then I don't want to die.

09:54.340 --> 09:56.220
[Zhou Dongnan Road S32]

09:55.200 --> 09:57.200
Then take the next bus. Don't get on.

09:57.500 --> 10:00.230
You think you can stop me?

10:01.550 --> 10:02.270
Charge!

10:04.000 --> 10:05.200
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

10:05.270 --> 10:06.470
The door won't close.

10:06.480 --> 10:07.630
Move in a bit more.

10:10.790 --> 10:11.670
In the past,

10:12.790 --> 10:14.220
did you commute every day

10:14.920 --> 10:16.280
and hug people?

10:18.240 --> 10:20.100
No one else is doing this like you.

10:20.870 --> 10:23.600
You make it sound like
I'm throwing myself at you.

10:24.080 --> 10:25.920
Don't overthink it.

10:26.270 --> 10:28.330
I'm telling you, to me,

10:28.550 --> 10:30.470
you're just a tomboy, you know?

10:32.790 --> 10:34.670
I really want to throw up
the pancake on your face.

10:34.670 --> 10:35.840
I ate more than you.

10:35.840 --> 10:38.370
If anyone is throwing up,
it'll be me on yours.

10:51.240 --> 10:51.980
Oh, my God.

10:54.600 --> 10:57.200
Assistant Qian, Master's books
have arrived at the front desk.

10:57.200 --> 10:59.200
Please check them against the list.

11:01.870 --> 11:03.030
[Oh, okay.]

11:08.020 --> 11:11.750
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

11:27.790 --> 11:32.250
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

11:44.210 --> 11:45.590
[Shopping List]

12:04.940 --> 12:08.020
[Shopping List]

12:09.960 --> 12:10.790
Why am I always the one

12:10.790 --> 12:12.550
doing manual labor for you wherever I go?

12:12.550 --> 12:15.210
Why complain about your duties
as an assistant?

12:16.800 --> 12:19.260
Can you even finish reading
all these books?

12:20.810 --> 12:22.790
If I can't even finish these,

12:22.810 --> 12:24.430
how can I keep this position?

12:25.840 --> 12:26.950
Keep pretending.

12:35.960 --> 12:37.720
[Office Area]

12:45.270 --> 12:46.520
[Product Name]

12:57.640 --> 12:59.090
[How does money operate?]

13:03.550 --> 13:05.340
[How does money work?]

13:21.550 --> 13:25.490
Where did you go so early on a weekend?

13:28.000 --> 13:29.410
What's in this box?

13:29.790 --> 13:30.550
Is it heavy?

13:30.600 --> 13:31.120
Let me help you.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.330
No need.

13:32.440 --> 13:33.270
I'll carry it myself.

13:33.270 --> 13:34.030
You just sit there.

13:34.030 --> 13:34.960
No need.

13:34.960 --> 13:35.790
Just sit there.

13:35.790 --> 13:37.550
Let me help you.
No, no, no.

13:40.750 --> 13:42.260
So mysterious.

14:31.800 --> 14:33.170
If such an arrogant guy,

14:33.200 --> 14:34.930
a spoiled brat who can't
take care of himself,

14:34.930 --> 14:37.060
can be an investment banking elite...

14:37.070 --> 14:38.400
It's just reading.

14:38.930 --> 14:39.930
I'm the best at it.

14:57.960 --> 14:59.170
You didn't go out?

14:59.390 --> 15:01.200
You're just sitting in the living room?

15:01.200 --> 15:02.450
Right back at you.

15:11.600 --> 15:13.180
Pass the ball. Pass, pass, pass.

15:13.180 --> 15:13.960
Pass!

15:18.180 --> 15:19.620
Shoot!

15:20.170 --> 15:22.020
You scared me. Don't be so jumpy.

15:39.480 --> 15:41.610
What are you looking at behind my back?

15:43.090 --> 15:45.460
[Yu]

15:47.740 --> 15:48.770
Hello, Yu.

15:48.810 --> 15:49.690
Hello, Fei.

15:50.110 --> 15:51.730
Your backstage manager, He Li,

15:51.730 --> 15:53.710
broke her leg as she fell down
the stairs yesterday.

15:53.710 --> 15:54.870
I knew that just now.

15:55.320 --> 15:56.780
How is she now?

15:57.220 --> 15:58.240
She had surgery.

15:58.420 --> 16:00.410
Other colleagues went to visit
her this morning.

16:00.410 --> 16:02.070
You'd probably go see her too.

16:02.610 --> 16:05.340
Okay. Manager He has always
taken good care of me.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.570
Send me the hospital's address.

16:12.050 --> 16:13.920
Going out again?

16:14.550 --> 16:16.320
Didn't you hear my phone call?

16:17.920 --> 16:19.120
When will you be back?

16:19.120 --> 16:21.480
You promised to make me
some good dishes.

16:22.100 --> 16:23.200
For your hearty dishes,

16:23.200 --> 16:24.510
I turned down eight plans tonight.

16:24.510 --> 16:26.980
Don't worry. I'll definitely be
back before dinner.

16:26.980 --> 16:28.580
Are you going empty-handed?

16:29.040 --> 16:30.320
I'll go to the nearby flower shop

16:30.320 --> 16:31.580
to buy a flower basket.

16:35.670 --> 16:37.720
Definitely back before dinner.

16:38.940 --> 16:39.510
Okay.

17:48.750 --> 17:49.710
That's all.

17:52.610 --> 17:53.280
Wait here.

18:24.550 --> 18:25.350
Kid.

18:25.750 --> 18:27.480
Can you exchange 500 in cash for me?

18:27.480 --> 18:29.340
I'll transfer it to you on WeChat.

18:55.920 --> 18:57.850
Now you can't spend it all, can you?

18:58.410 --> 19:00.780
Then, cook good meals for me.

19:11.560 --> 19:13.560
Bro, you've been lying here all day?

19:16.890 --> 19:18.050
How was today?

19:18.380 --> 19:20.300
How did your chat with the supervisor go?

19:20.300 --> 19:22.630
Pretty good. We had a great time chatting.

19:23.250 --> 19:24.110
That's not bad.

19:24.970 --> 19:26.370
Then hurry up and cook, landlady.

19:26.370 --> 19:27.170
I'm starving.

19:27.830 --> 19:28.690
You're hungry?

19:29.940 --> 19:30.550
Okay.

19:31.640 --> 19:33.170
Wash this if you're hungry.

19:34.920 --> 19:35.650
What is this?

19:38.160 --> 19:39.890
Enough is enough, landlady.

19:40.310 --> 19:41.520
Making me wash the dishes was bad enough.

19:41.520 --> 19:43.720
Now you're forcing me to wash vegetables?

19:43.720 --> 19:44.810
Don't you want to eat?

19:44.810 --> 19:46.010
Go wash it if you want.

19:47.140 --> 19:48.310
Let me tell you.

19:48.970 --> 19:51.570
This is the last time
I wash vegetables for you.

19:51.960 --> 19:53.020
The very last time.

19:54.130 --> 19:56.350
There will never be a second time.

19:56.930 --> 20:00.470
If you ever dare make me
wash vegetables again,

20:00.680 --> 20:02.720
you'll face the consequences.

20:02.740 --> 20:04.770
I will never be polite to you.

20:12.600 --> 20:15.000
You know how fast I
chop vegetables, right?

20:17.070 --> 20:18.790
I'm really afraid that

20:19.260 --> 20:20.860
one day I might accidentally

20:21.350 --> 20:22.860
throw this knife at you.

20:23.110 --> 20:24.520
Don't wave that thing around here.

20:24.520 --> 20:25.180
It's scary.

20:25.470 --> 20:27.530
Is this something you can joke about?

20:27.640 --> 20:28.430
Okay, okay, I'll wash them.

20:28.430 --> 20:30.090
Put it away quickly. Hurry up.

20:30.880 --> 20:32.140
Hurry up and wash them.

20:32.920 --> 20:33.650
Put it down.

20:33.670 --> 20:34.180
Hurry up.

20:34.180 --> 20:35.200
Put it down quickly.

20:35.200 --> 20:37.040
Waving it around is so scary.

20:37.720 --> 20:38.600
Hurry up.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.120
I'll take out everything
that needs washing.

20:41.120 --> 20:42.250
Wash them one by one.

20:43.400 --> 20:45.260
Wash this one too.

20:46.750 --> 20:47.880
Why are there more?

20:49.570 --> 20:51.370
Don't you want to eat eggplants?

20:52.810 --> 20:53.670
And this fish.

20:55.540 --> 20:58.000
You might as well just
let me finish cooking.

21:00.010 --> 21:03.540
If you love eggplants so much,
why don't you grow them yourself?

21:10.570 --> 21:11.800
At your speed,

21:12.590 --> 21:14.850
will I be able to eat by tomorrow morning?

21:22.940 --> 21:24.270
This is the living room.

21:27.170 --> 21:28.140
Stop shaking.

21:28.510 --> 21:30.440
I don't want to see your apartment.

21:31.310 --> 21:32.840
Then what do you want to see?

21:33.550 --> 21:34.590
Tell me.

21:34.760 --> 21:36.790
Isn't your new apartment renovated?

21:36.790 --> 21:37.570
Why aren't you living there?

21:37.570 --> 21:39.400
Why did you rent another one?

21:39.870 --> 21:41.170
It can't be cheap, right?

21:41.170 --> 21:42.500
And what about Qian Fei?

21:43.100 --> 21:44.520
She... She's on a business trip.

21:44.520 --> 21:45.690
I told you.

21:45.720 --> 21:47.570
Then I'll just call her directly.

21:47.570 --> 21:48.780
No, Mom.

21:48.830 --> 21:51.670
Well, she just joined a new project team.

21:51.860 --> 21:53.020
I don't even dare to bother her,

21:53.020 --> 21:54.540
so please don't bother her.

21:54.540 --> 21:55.320
Rest assured.

21:55.320 --> 21:57.050
Your mom won't bother Qian Fei.

21:57.200 --> 21:58.950
She's just talking.

22:00.400 --> 22:02.870
There are some issues
with the new house's renovation.

22:02.870 --> 22:04.070
It's being reworked.

22:04.110 --> 22:05.740
I just changed jobs,

22:05.770 --> 22:07.770
so I need to move to a classier place.

22:07.770 --> 22:09.370
I'll have guests over often,

22:09.540 --> 22:11.000
so it'll make me look good.

22:12.630 --> 22:13.980
Someone's here, Mom.

22:14.010 --> 22:15.040
I have to go now.

22:15.290 --> 22:16.250
Bye.

22:25.220 --> 22:25.920
Come in.

22:37.380 --> 22:38.980
Why do you keep looking at me?

22:39.800 --> 22:41.210
I like watching men cook.

22:41.970 --> 22:42.730
It's cozy

22:43.230 --> 22:44.070
and warm.

22:46.150 --> 22:48.080
Did you use to cook for Qian Fei too?

22:50.970 --> 22:52.230
Actually, I never did.

22:56.060 --> 22:57.460
I suddenly feel so happy.

23:01.690 --> 23:02.320
Let me get that.

23:02.320 --> 23:02.880
Okay.

23:06.990 --> 23:07.590
Thank you.

23:09.630 --> 23:12.880
Your mom was here just now,
so it wasn't a good time to tell you

23:12.880 --> 23:15.390
that your mom's illness has gotten worse.

23:15.940 --> 23:16.910
The doctor said

23:16.940 --> 23:19.010
if she gets a kidney transplant,

23:19.040 --> 23:20.290
it will cost hundreds of thousands.

23:20.290 --> 23:21.350
Calculate how much

23:21.550 --> 23:22.920
you can come up with.

23:23.620 --> 23:24.480
What?

23:24.500 --> 23:25.700
What WeChat message?

23:26.970 --> 23:27.630
Nothing.

23:27.900 --> 23:29.700
Go sit over there and wait for me.

23:29.820 --> 23:31.420
I'll call you when it's done.

23:32.550 --> 23:34.730
Ruohai, was that message

23:34.750 --> 23:36.510
from Qian Fei?

23:38.860 --> 23:40.060
How is that possible?

23:40.910 --> 23:43.380
We haven't been in touch
since we broke up.

23:44.650 --> 23:46.500
During her time at our company,

23:46.520 --> 23:47.840
we never sent any WeChat messages
to each other,

23:47.840 --> 23:49.260
let alone phone calls.

23:50.840 --> 23:52.080
I'm just teasing you.

23:56.140 --> 23:57.480
Don't you trust me?

23:57.640 --> 23:58.510
No.

23:58.930 --> 24:00.740
It's my fault. My bad.

24:01.040 --> 24:02.660
I won't ask that again.

24:03.340 --> 24:04.110
Okay?

24:06.620 --> 24:07.480
Okay.

24:09.320 --> 24:10.810
Then go rest for a while.

24:11.050 --> 24:13.160
I can't chop
when you're hugging me like this.

24:13.160 --> 24:13.770
Okay?

24:15.110 --> 24:16.970
It's so comfortable hugging you.

24:18.040 --> 24:20.170
I want to hug you
for the rest of my life.

24:43.130 --> 24:44.460
What are you looking at?

24:46.810 --> 24:47.500
Well...

24:48.510 --> 24:49.240
You helped me

24:49.250 --> 24:50.710
clean up my room last time.

24:51.250 --> 24:52.940
I thought it was pretty good.

24:56.070 --> 24:57.330
Don't talk to me in riddles.

24:57.330 --> 24:58.880
I won't clean for you again.

25:01.900 --> 25:04.510
I don't mind. It's fine if it's messy.

25:06.610 --> 25:08.660
But maybe it's too messy,

25:09.010 --> 25:10.740
so I just saw a few cockroaches.

25:13.150 --> 25:14.290
Cockroaches?

25:14.420 --> 25:16.040
You... you mean there are
cockroaches in my room?

25:16.040 --> 25:17.750
It's fine. I'm really fine.

25:17.770 --> 25:20.440
Anyway, I can live with cockroaches.

25:20.660 --> 25:21.670
They're my bros.

25:21.700 --> 25:22.880
Let them run around if they want.

25:22.880 --> 25:23.820
I don't mind.

25:24.000 --> 25:25.510
Li Yifei,

25:25.750 --> 25:27.590
I really hate you.

25:30.910 --> 25:32.710
I won't let you do it for nothing.

25:35.470 --> 25:36.670
I'll raise your rent.

25:38.610 --> 25:39.210
Let go.

25:44.940 --> 25:46.400
You scoundrel.

25:48.920 --> 25:51.770
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

25:52.850 --> 25:56.470
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

25:57.100 --> 25:58.790
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

25:59.290 --> 26:00.900
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

26:00.930 --> 26:02.050
How much raise?

26:01.270 --> 26:03.310
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

26:02.800 --> 26:04.430
How much do you want?

26:03.840 --> 26:05.580
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

26:04.450 --> 26:05.400
300 yuan a month.

26:05.490 --> 26:06.870
Again?

26:06.280 --> 26:09.980
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

26:06.890 --> 26:08.690
Are you a gangster?

26:10.620 --> 26:14.220
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

26:14.750 --> 26:16.300
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

26:16.850 --> 26:18.340
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

26:18.870 --> 26:21.180
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

26:21.690 --> 26:23.290
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

26:23.600 --> 26:27.340
♪ Why is it you again?
In such a sweet tone ♪

26:27.790 --> 26:31.850
♪ It's like the whole world knows
I miss you ♪

26:32.470 --> 26:36.150
♪ Why is it always you?
With a cool chuckle ♪

26:36.610 --> 26:40.490
♪ Let me play along and protect you ♪

26:52.890 --> 26:53.930
Wait.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.720
Well, this needs to be dry-cleaned.

26:55.720 --> 26:56.780
Just leave it here.

26:56.820 --> 26:58.930
These are all the clothes
in your closet, right?

26:58.930 --> 26:59.910
You're going to dry-clean them all?

26:59.910 --> 27:00.790
Do you know how much that will cost?

27:00.790 --> 27:02.680
And you're dry-cleaning your socks too?

27:02.680 --> 27:04.410
Can't you wash them by hand?

27:04.540 --> 27:05.670
Or what else can I do?

27:08.270 --> 27:10.570
Do you not have hands or a brain?

27:10.780 --> 27:13.180
You don't know how to
use a washing machine?

27:13.990 --> 27:14.990
Wait, wait, wait.

27:15.790 --> 27:16.510
Watch closely.

27:16.510 --> 27:18.980
I'll teach you how to use
the washing machine today.

27:18.980 --> 27:20.190
First, open this.

27:20.220 --> 27:21.900
Then put this piece of clothing

27:21.900 --> 27:23.660
and all your fake designer clothes in.

27:23.660 --> 27:24.740
Wait, wait, wait.

27:25.070 --> 27:27.800
How can you tell these are
fake designer clothes?

27:27.860 --> 27:29.160
Do I even need to tell?

27:29.290 --> 27:30.480
If they were all real,

27:30.480 --> 27:31.960
would you be sharing an apartment with me?

27:31.960 --> 27:33.540
If you could afford the real ones,

27:33.540 --> 27:34.900
you would have moved out long ago.

27:34.900 --> 27:36.200
But you're really something.

27:36.200 --> 27:37.590
You have a great mindset,

27:37.590 --> 27:39.740
wearing these knockoffs
like they're authentic,

27:39.740 --> 27:42.010
and wandering around
in the crowd.

27:42.040 --> 27:43.620
Let me tell you,

27:43.720 --> 27:46.680
saving money is the absolute truth.

27:46.700 --> 27:49.960
Have you been watching too many
stand-up comedies lately?

27:50.630 --> 27:52.030
What's the next step?

27:52.570 --> 27:53.910
Sort them by color first,

27:53.910 --> 27:55.690
and put all the dark clothes in.

27:55.750 --> 27:56.860
Alright.

27:57.760 --> 27:58.730
Close it.

27:59.260 --> 28:02.110
Open this and pour the detergent in.

28:02.390 --> 28:03.150
Pour it in.

28:05.190 --> 28:06.510
Pull the drawer open.

28:11.600 --> 28:13.700
Then turn on the water tap,

28:14.850 --> 28:15.740
and that's it.

28:16.450 --> 28:17.970
Isn't it simple, bro?

28:18.490 --> 28:19.560
Does such a simple task

28:19.560 --> 28:21.820
require a high-IQ person like me to do it?

28:23.030 --> 28:24.660
Then why doesn't this high-IQ person

28:24.660 --> 28:26.520
know how to use a washing machine?

28:28.750 --> 28:29.880
Come here and learn.

28:33.850 --> 28:35.100
Don't you want to eat?

28:35.120 --> 28:36.610
Of course I do.

28:36.960 --> 28:38.150
I've had a light appetite lately.

28:38.150 --> 28:39.580
I want something light.

28:39.600 --> 28:41.200
For example, tonight we can have

28:41.200 --> 28:44.200
sliced meat in hot chili oil,
stir-fried pork with green peppers,

28:44.200 --> 28:45.590
and braised pork.

28:45.610 --> 28:46.540
Then learn.

28:51.070 --> 28:52.960
Beggars can't be choosers.

28:52.980 --> 28:54.060
Tell me, what should I do?

28:54.060 --> 28:55.030
How?

28:55.560 --> 28:57.120
I just talked to you for a long time.

28:57.120 --> 28:57.590
Didn't

28:57.610 --> 28:58.850
you hear anything?

29:02.440 --> 29:03.810
Then you, a person with a high IQ,

29:03.810 --> 29:04.640
figure it out yourself.

29:04.640 --> 29:06.170
I'm going to buy groceries.

29:07.760 --> 29:09.670
Aren't you smart? Learn it yourself.

29:09.670 --> 29:11.070
Pay for it if you break it.

29:20.590 --> 29:21.240
On.

29:21.260 --> 29:21.890
Off.

29:52.790 --> 29:53.850
What are you doing?

29:54.290 --> 29:55.030
Are you being punished to sit here?

29:55.030 --> 29:55.980
I'm waiting for you.

29:55.980 --> 29:57.250
Are you tired of carrying
all this food?

29:57.250 --> 29:58.060
Here, let me.

29:58.080 --> 29:59.210
Why are you waiting for me?

29:59.210 --> 30:00.540
I have good news for you.

30:00.540 --> 30:01.620
Downstairs in our neighborhood,

30:01.620 --> 30:02.830
the scenery is beautiful right now,

30:02.830 --> 30:03.810
and the flowers are blooming.

30:03.810 --> 30:04.190
Come on,

30:04.190 --> 30:05.180
let's go for a walk.

30:05.180 --> 30:06.240
Let's walk for an hour
and then come back. Go.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.000
Wait.

30:07.500 --> 30:08.500
Li Yifei.

30:08.780 --> 30:10.610
Were you playing with fire in the house

30:10.610 --> 30:12.160
and set the place on fire?

30:12.180 --> 30:13.970
So, the firefighters are putting
out a fire inside.

30:13.970 --> 30:15.070
What are you thinking?

30:15.070 --> 30:17.070
You really have a rich imagination.

30:17.330 --> 30:18.740
Did you see a fire truck
when you came back

30:18.740 --> 30:19.540
or what?

30:21.460 --> 30:22.460
Unbelievable.

30:24.790 --> 30:26.320
The house is fine.

30:27.630 --> 30:29.760
At most, the floor is a little damaged.

30:30.590 --> 30:32.290
When I was doing the laundry,

30:32.350 --> 30:33.560
I came out and saw

30:33.580 --> 30:35.400
that the washing machine

30:35.400 --> 30:36.910
had overflowed a little bit of water.

30:36.910 --> 30:38.410
What do you mean by a little?

30:38.410 --> 30:39.960
Not much.

30:39.980 --> 30:41.780
It just reached the living room.

30:42.490 --> 30:43.830
-No. Listen to me.
-I hate you!

30:43.830 --> 30:44.430
Listen to me.

30:44.430 --> 30:46.090
That... that wasn't my fault.

31:05.340 --> 31:07.190
My dearest landlady.

31:07.770 --> 31:09.750
I've already mopped the floor once.

31:09.750 --> 31:11.350
And I've opened the windows.

31:13.260 --> 31:14.210
In an hour,

31:14.230 --> 31:15.450
with the wind blowing,

31:15.450 --> 31:17.310
the floor will definitely be dry.

31:19.990 --> 31:22.520
Only the homeowner cares
about her own house.

31:22.860 --> 31:25.340
Look, so much water got sucked out again.

31:27.380 --> 31:29.470
As for the money to repair the furniture,

31:29.470 --> 31:31.940
I'll give it to you when I pay
the rent next time.

31:31.940 --> 31:33.470
You're offering higher rent

31:33.470 --> 31:34.770
and money for this.

31:35.140 --> 31:37.290
Where would you get so much money for me?

31:37.290 --> 31:39.620
I'll be the one suffering
a loss in the end.

31:40.990 --> 31:42.170
You can't blame me for that.

31:42.170 --> 31:43.850
I told you

31:43.870 --> 31:45.670
that I can't do this heavy work.

31:46.030 --> 31:47.330
How about this? When you do the laundry,

31:47.330 --> 31:48.110
you can just do me a favor

31:48.110 --> 31:49.910
and wash my clothes as well.

31:50.160 --> 31:50.990
Look,

31:51.860 --> 31:53.160
you can raise the rent

31:53.180 --> 31:54.830
and don't have to fix the floor.

31:54.830 --> 31:56.060
Killing three birds with one stone.

31:56.060 --> 31:57.020
Why should I?

32:00.900 --> 32:02.300
Low blood pressure, huh?

32:02.590 --> 32:04.220
Don't get so worked up.

32:04.250 --> 32:05.450
Come, sit for a while.

32:06.690 --> 32:07.620
Rest for a while.

32:19.930 --> 32:21.260
Are you feeling better?

32:22.480 --> 32:23.210
Much better.

32:24.630 --> 32:26.560
Let me discuss something with you.

32:27.790 --> 32:29.670
Can you move out of my house?

32:30.640 --> 32:32.960
Don't just torment me, okay?

32:34.000 --> 32:34.720
I'm tired.

32:40.530 --> 32:41.770
What happened?

32:48.520 --> 32:49.720
To tell you the truth,

32:50.650 --> 32:52.050
you might not believe it.

32:57.060 --> 32:58.280
When I was young,

32:59.650 --> 33:01.060
my family was very poor.

33:03.560 --> 33:05.420
My dad raised me all by himself.

33:08.460 --> 33:10.170
We used to depend on each other

33:11.930 --> 33:13.580
and had an okay life.

33:16.110 --> 33:17.790
Later, because of a woman,

33:21.520 --> 33:23.700
he wanted to disown me.

33:27.750 --> 33:29.000
Unexpectedly, the woman

33:29.000 --> 33:30.530
ran away with someone else,

33:32.250 --> 33:33.530
leaving me

33:35.150 --> 33:35.870
alone.

33:38.290 --> 33:40.820
That's why I can't even wash
clothes well now.

33:41.330 --> 33:42.050
Tell me,

33:43.830 --> 33:46.470
is my life a complete failure?

33:48.540 --> 33:50.230
I just can't think about it, you know?

33:50.230 --> 33:50.950
Whenever I do,

33:50.950 --> 33:52.990
I feel life is meaningless.

33:53.960 --> 33:55.280
The sky is dusty.

33:55.310 --> 33:58.870
-My heart is dusty too.
-What are you doing?

33:58.900 --> 34:00.840
What are you doing? Don't be impulsive.

34:00.840 --> 34:02.550
What's bothering you?

34:02.570 --> 34:05.030
I really can't stand you
acting so pathetic.

34:05.290 --> 34:07.230
I was just being impulsive.
What was I doing?

34:07.230 --> 34:08.270
Oh my god.

34:10.080 --> 34:11.639
I'm so mad at you.

34:12.239 --> 34:13.830
-I’m sorry.
-When I was listening to your mumble,

34:13.830 --> 34:15.429
I just felt

34:15.449 --> 34:17.010
panicked and

34:17.040 --> 34:18.400
terrified.

34:18.469 --> 34:19.469
When you tell me this,

34:19.469 --> 34:21.120
what am I supposed to say?

34:21.270 --> 34:23.330
I'm sorry for making a fool of myself.

34:24.350 --> 34:27.370
You make it sound as
if I say the wrong thing,

34:27.400 --> 34:29.050
I'll drive you into a corner.

34:29.719 --> 34:31.850
And I'll have to take responsibility.

34:33.050 --> 34:33.699
Then,

34:34.290 --> 34:36.500
can you at least take the clothes out?

34:37.560 --> 34:38.199
Okay.

34:38.230 --> 34:39.210
I'll go cook.

34:49.130 --> 34:51.530
Come over after putting away your clothes.

35:05.740 --> 35:07.280
Your appetite has been growing lately.

35:07.280 --> 35:09.410
Is this little rice not enough for you?

35:10.080 --> 35:12.280
It's mainly because you're a good cook.

35:12.340 --> 35:14.470
The food makes me want to eat more rice.

35:16.080 --> 35:17.470
Seeing how pitiful you are,

35:17.470 --> 35:19.270
I'll give you another spoonful.

35:20.150 --> 35:21.260
This much should be enough.

35:21.260 --> 35:22.230
Come and see.

35:28.830 --> 35:30.700
This...

35:30.720 --> 35:32.550
Even if not being dried clean,
such clothes

35:32.550 --> 35:34.810
can't be tossed into the washing machine.

35:34.810 --> 35:35.620
They'll get ruined.

35:35.620 --> 35:36.990
At the very least,

35:37.340 --> 35:38.850
they have to be hand-washed.

35:38.850 --> 35:40.330
Do they have to be so picky?

35:40.360 --> 35:42.470
I shouldn't have taught you
how to use the washing machine.

35:42.470 --> 35:43.770
I should've let you take them
to the dry cleaner

35:43.770 --> 35:44.720
and squander all your money.

35:44.720 --> 35:46.120
Then you can't spend money
to dress up then.

35:46.120 --> 35:47.410
You are just a spendthrift.

35:47.410 --> 35:48.370
Now I see.

35:48.390 --> 35:50.000
A spoiled rich boy.

35:50.690 --> 35:51.570
Tell me,

35:51.950 --> 35:53.330
what do you do

35:53.350 --> 35:55.280
by dressing so flashily every day?

35:58.300 --> 35:59.880
Alright, I didn't mean

35:59.910 --> 36:02.910
to embarrass you by exposing
that you wear knockoffs.

36:03.270 --> 36:05.320
But just fake it when you're out.

36:05.340 --> 36:06.760
We live together.

36:07.440 --> 36:09.640
Why do you have to pretend
in front of me?

36:10.000 --> 36:11.080
Can you hide it?

36:15.400 --> 36:17.500
Don't put on that miserable look.

36:17.600 --> 36:19.530
You're lack self-care skills.

36:19.550 --> 36:22.210
It's not easy for you
to have survived until now.

36:22.350 --> 36:23.210
How about this?

36:23.350 --> 36:26.130
From now on, I allow you to

36:26.160 --> 36:27.940
keep your trust fund baby dreams
in front of me.

36:27.940 --> 36:28.670
Is that okay?

36:34.210 --> 36:35.940
Put your clothes away quickly.

36:43.020 --> 36:44.130
I have a dream

36:44.960 --> 36:46.220
of being a rich kid.

37:11.790 --> 37:12.990
Time to eat.

37:17.110 --> 37:18.240
Time to eat.

37:28.860 --> 37:30.160
Time to eat.

37:30.880 --> 37:32.520
You scared me.

37:33.560 --> 37:34.990
I find that my toil

37:35.020 --> 37:36.200
is totally my own fault.

37:36.200 --> 37:37.660
I can't blame anyone else.

37:53.730 --> 37:54.450
I'll dig in.

37:54.480 --> 37:55.040
Hold on.

37:57.990 --> 37:59.590
I have something to tell you.

38:00.150 --> 38:01.110
What is it?

38:05.700 --> 38:08.970
[Housework Price List]

38:12.480 --> 38:13.320
This is...

38:14.760 --> 38:16.360
I can help you with housework,

38:16.360 --> 38:18.340
sweeping the floor, washing the dishes,

38:18.340 --> 38:20.340
cooking, and doing the laundry.

38:20.500 --> 38:26.020
[Housework Price List]

38:21.080 --> 38:21.900
But

38:22.390 --> 38:24.940
you have to pay according
to the price tag.

38:25.130 --> 38:26.390
Here is the price list.

38:31.220 --> 38:32.940
[Housework Price List]

38:33.120 --> 38:35.550
The prices are quite reasonable.

38:35.880 --> 38:36.840
So you agree?

38:38.000 --> 38:38.440
Okay.

38:39.810 --> 38:40.650
Hold on.

38:53.930 --> 38:55.900
Isn't this a similar one?

38:57.390 --> 38:59.470
You know what? I bought this
when I was a kid.

38:59.470 --> 39:01.630
Where did you get a matching one?

39:01.890 --> 39:03.550
You're so thoughtful, landlady.

39:03.550 --> 39:05.100
If you could buy it when you were a kid,

39:05.100 --> 39:06.360
couldn't I do the same?

39:06.370 --> 39:07.770
This is also from my childhood.

39:07.770 --> 39:08.900
Really?

39:08.960 --> 39:10.650
What a coincidence.

39:11.270 --> 39:13.430
No wonder we can live together.

39:13.450 --> 39:15.120
It's simply destiny.

39:15.510 --> 39:17.170
Everyone had one when we were kids.

39:17.170 --> 39:18.370
It's not fate.

39:19.590 --> 39:20.470
Anyway.

39:20.980 --> 39:23.400
For the money I earn,

39:23.430 --> 39:25.050
don't transfer it or send red packets,

39:25.050 --> 39:27.090
or deduct it from the next rent.

39:27.120 --> 39:28.440
Put it all in here.

39:28.990 --> 39:30.450
Come on, everyone uses
electronic payments now.

39:30.450 --> 39:32.490
Where am I supposed to get
so much cash to put in?

39:32.490 --> 39:33.400
I don't care.

39:34.060 --> 39:35.000
Anyway,

39:35.020 --> 39:38.000
seeing this jar get emptier

39:38.150 --> 39:40.460
gives me the motivation to keep cooking.

39:40.580 --> 39:42.310
One less meal to cook each time.

39:42.330 --> 39:44.210
Seeing this jar get fuller

39:44.460 --> 39:47.670
is the only way I can tolerate you
messing around in this house.

39:47.670 --> 39:48.880
And you don't have to rack your brains

39:48.880 --> 39:50.410
to find all kinds of excuses

39:50.920 --> 39:52.550
to make me do the chores.

39:54.010 --> 39:54.970
Besides,

39:55.160 --> 39:57.760
you seem to really enjoy
watching me do chores.

40:00.610 --> 40:01.390
What are you talking about?

40:01.390 --> 40:03.000
I've never watched you

40:03.000 --> 40:04.540
do chores.

40:04.760 --> 40:06.490
I saw it.

40:09.720 --> 40:10.450
Fine.

40:10.480 --> 40:12.000
Are you done calculating? Let's eat.

40:12.000 --> 40:12.800
Hold on.

40:13.100 --> 40:14.770
What now?

40:15.160 --> 40:16.160
Cooking rice is 10 yuan,

40:16.160 --> 40:16.950
stir-frying is 10 yuan,

40:16.950 --> 40:18.450
and washing clothes is 50 yuan.

40:18.450 --> 40:19.780
That's 70 yuan in total.

40:23.270 --> 40:23.740
How about this?

40:23.740 --> 40:24.640
I'll put this meal on credit.

40:24.640 --> 40:25.280
On credit.

40:25.310 --> 40:26.030
No way.

40:27.030 --> 40:28.200
I don't have money right now.

40:28.200 --> 40:29.200
I don't have any cash.

40:29.200 --> 40:31.530
I have to go downstairs
to get some change.

40:32.810 --> 40:34.270
I'll transfer the money
to you after eating.

40:34.270 --> 40:35.130
No, I'll put them in after eating.

40:35.130 --> 40:36.060
Put them inside.

40:46.920 --> 40:47.770
Worth it.

40:49.000 --> 40:49.870
This dish is worth the price.

40:49.870 --> 40:51.300
It's quite cheap.

40:58.450 --> 40:59.780
You charged too little.

40:59.900 --> 41:01.040
This is worth at least 30 yuan.

41:01.040 --> 41:02.040
How could it be 10?

41:02.040 --> 41:04.170
Alright, transfer 90 yuan to me later.

41:04.290 --> 41:05.440
I am really sorry.

41:06.040 --> 41:07.040
It's not just you.

41:07.870 --> 41:10.660
There are several subsidiaries
being spun off

41:10.690 --> 41:12.090
from the group this time.

41:12.330 --> 41:15.290
This is related to the group's
future listing

41:15.320 --> 41:16.550
and subsequent development.

41:16.550 --> 41:18.490
Later, our relevant colleagues

41:18.660 --> 41:19.800
will come to Xinxin Vision

41:19.800 --> 41:22.000
and connect with your financial staff.

41:22.350 --> 41:23.630
This is unfair to us.

41:24.800 --> 41:26.560
The valuation of our assets

41:26.590 --> 41:28.590
was done by Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

41:28.830 --> 41:30.280
Xinxin Vision, as a subsidiary,

41:30.280 --> 41:32.250
has no right to participate
in the valuation.

41:32.250 --> 41:32.930
Now,

41:33.060 --> 41:35.080
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group
wrongly overestimated

41:35.080 --> 41:36.700
Xinxin Vision's intangible assets,

41:36.700 --> 41:38.710
affecting the group's
financial assessment.

41:38.710 --> 41:40.940
That shouldn't come at our expense.

41:40.960 --> 41:42.690
Shouldn't we bear it together?

41:48.410 --> 41:50.180
When the chairman came to
talk to me about the acquisition,

41:50.180 --> 41:51.340
he didn't say that.

41:51.910 --> 41:53.570
I request to see the chairman.

41:54.280 --> 41:55.550
What I'm saying today

41:55.910 --> 41:58.370
is what he authorized
me to discuss with you.

42:00.140 --> 42:01.330
Over the past three years,

42:01.330 --> 42:03.460
Xinxin Vision has been poorly managed

42:03.460 --> 42:04.770
and constantly losing money.

42:04.770 --> 42:06.680
Without Shan Li Fang Hotel Group,

42:07.040 --> 42:09.570
Xinxin Vision wouldn't have
made it to today.

42:10.630 --> 42:11.500
Of course,

42:11.870 --> 42:13.550
we don't want to see Xinxin Vision

42:13.550 --> 42:14.470
end like this.

42:14.920 --> 42:17.780
Our financial director has
prepared a plan for you.

42:17.880 --> 42:19.040
Before the spin-off,

42:19.040 --> 42:21.040
if you find an investor to take over,

42:21.380 --> 42:23.380
we can cooperate with the handover.

42:29.020 --> 42:31.480
I will definitely find someone
to take over.

42:31.510 --> 42:32.630
I won't give up.

42:35.640 --> 42:38.290
The capital market is just this cruel.

42:38.310 --> 42:41.630
You don't always get rewarded just
because you put in the effort.

42:41.630 --> 42:42.510
Just like you,

42:42.680 --> 42:45.890
the sponsor institution responsible
for the group's listing this time

42:45.890 --> 42:47.220
also taught me a lesson.

42:48.560 --> 42:49.690
He Jing Securities.

42:52.510 --> 42:53.800
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.320 --> 42:55.450
Here's this for you.

42:58.560 --> 42:59.680
Don't you think

42:59.700 --> 43:01.510
it looks exactly like
my tenant>

43:02.300 --> 43:02.930
Look.

43:02.960 --> 43:04.020
These little gold buttons

43:04.020 --> 43:05.300
and this suit,

43:05.420 --> 43:07.360
especially when pretending
to be innocent and pitiful.

43:07.360 --> 43:08.370
It's so annoying.

43:08.390 --> 43:09.340
I'll beat you to death.

43:09.340 --> 43:10.550
Something's wrong with you.

43:10.550 --> 43:12.050
I made too much. Do you want
to eat together?

43:12.050 --> 43:12.760
No.

43:14.020 --> 43:15.680
Someone already asked me out.

43:15.710 --> 43:16.780
If

43:16.800 --> 43:18.820
you want to have dinner with me too,

43:19.290 --> 43:19.900
next time,

43:19.950 --> 43:21.580
remember to book in advance.
